<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', position: 'relative' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: 1280, height: 6, background: '#0E3F8C' }} />
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 40, top: 34, width: 1200, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 32, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>布线结果：三层七门，逻辑可证</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>02　设计与布线</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 40, top: 92, width: 1200, height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 40, top: 112, width: 720 }}>
        <Image src="assets/topology.png" style={{ width: 720, height: 441, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', textAlign: 'center', marginTop: 4 }}>
            图 1　Cello 自动布线结果（assignment A000）：三层级联，6 个内部逻辑门 + 1 个输出级
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 790, top: 118, width: 450 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
            {[
                { v: '3', k: '层级' },
                { v: '7', k: '门模块' },
                { v: '6', k: '阻遏蛋白' },
            ].map((s) => (
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #C7D8EF', borderRadius: 6, padding: 12, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>{s.v}</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 2 }}>{s.k}</Text>
                </Box>
            ))}
        </Box>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 22 }}>按门逐一展开，验证布尔等价</Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 10, padding: 16, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.95 }}>
                n6 = ¬A　　n5 = ¬B　　n2 = ¬C
                <br />
                n3 = ¬(A ∨ B)
                <br />
                n4 = ¬(n6 ∨ n5) = A ∧ B
                <br />
                n1 = ¬(n2 ∨ n3) = C ∧ (A ∨ B)
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 16, padding: 14, background: '#E8EFF8', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                OUT = n4 ∨ n1 = AB + C(A+B)
                <br />
                ≡ AB + AC + BC　✅ 与目标一致
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 12 }}>
            这一步不能省：自动工具可能给出"能跑但语义不同"的方案，必须人工复核。
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 40, top: 672, width: 1200, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>《合成生物学》课程设计 · 三输入多数表决基因线路</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>06 / 13</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
